      "comment": "Retrieves the current gateway identifier from BNGatewayAccess object.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load this pointer from stack parameter (ESP + 0x4)\n2. Access gateway ID field at offset +0xc from object base\n3. Return gateway ID as integer value\n4. Clean up stack (RET 0x4) removing this pointer parameter\n\nParameters:\nIMPLICIT: this pointer (BNGatewayAccess *) - Object instance containing gateway data\n\nReturns:\nint: Current gateway identifier from object field at offset +0xc\n     Returns whatever integer value is stored in the gateway field\n     No error conditions - direct field access\n\nSpecial Cases:\nSimple getter function with no validation or error handling\nDirect memory access to object field without bounds checking",
